# Hooks and shell scripts must keep LF line endings: with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows
# default) they would be checked out as CRLF, and sh/bash fail on the \r.
.githooks/** text eol=lf
*.sh         text eol=lf
# The Godot script the mod copies into a game: the same text on every machine, so "is it up to date" compares equal.
*.gd         text eol=lf
